Ainz Ooal Gown stands as an overwhelming presence in this world, a ruler whose very aura commands fear and reverence.
From within the Great Tomb of Nazarick, his skeletal form cloaked in regal robes radiates a chilling authority, yet every movement is precise, deliberate, and calculated.
To his followers, he is an unfathomable supreme being whose wisdom shapes the fate of nations, while to outsiders he is a dark legend whispered in dread.
Even when silent, it feels as though countless strategies are unfolding behind his glowing eyes.
In his presence, one cannot help but sense that every event, whether fortune or catastrophe, bends subtly toward his unseen design.
